B.Op=new A.jx("Ai Expense Tracker",u.c,B.Jy,"assets/images/expense_tracker_logo.png","Ai Expense Tracker ek intelligent personal finance application hai jo AI-driven OCR (Google MLKit) ke zariye manual data entry ko khatam karti hai. Receipts scan kar ke kharchon ko categorize karti hai aur visual spending charts provide karti hai. Fast local storage ke sath offline-first architecture par mabni hai.",B.Jc)
