B.IV=s(["Dedicated 3-role portals: Tailor, Client, and Admin control dashboard","Tailor catalog upload with Cloudinary CDN high-resolution image optimization","Category-based client browsing and custom body measurement order placement","Real-time order acceptance workflow with instant FCM push notifications","Live interactive order lifecycle progress tracking for clients","Comprehensive Admin management panel for all users, tailors, and orders"],t.s)
B.Oo=new A.jx("Stitch&Witch","Bespoke tailoring platform with dedicated Tailor, Client & Admin portals and real-time live order tracking.",B.JQ,"assets/images/stitch_logo.png","Stitch&Witch is an end-to-end bespoke fashion and tailoring platform featuring 3 dedicated role portals: Tailor, Client, and Admin. Tailors upload product catalogs with high-res photos to Cloudinary CDN, categorized in the Client app. Clients place custom measurement orders, tailors accept requests in real-time, and clients receive live interactive order tracking powered by Firebase Firestore and FCM notifications.",B.IV)
