B.HT=s(["Screen flow: Splash screen \u2794 Firebase Auth \u2794 Home communication dashboard","User discovery with name search and permission-gated friend request flow","Anti-spam connection lock: Messaging unlocks only when friend request is accepted","Ephemeral Status & Stories system visible exclusively to accepted friends","High-Definition voice and video calling powered by ZegoCloud RTC SDK","Architected with Provider state management, Firebase Firestore, and FCM push notifications"],t.s)
B.Or=new A.jx("ChatFlow","Real-time communication app with connection-gated messaging, stories/status updates, and ZegoCloud calling.",B.Kf,"assets/images/chatflow_logo.png","ChatFlow features a complete onboarding and communication pipeline: Splash \u2794 Firebase Auth \u2794 Home dashboard. Users search other users by name and send connection requests. Direct messaging is strictly locked until the recipient accepts the request. Friends can view and share ephemeral status stories, chat in real-time, and launch crystal-clear HD audio and video calls powered by ZegoCloud with Provider state management and FCM push notifications.",B.HT)
