B.On=new A.jx("Matrix POS",u.n,B.K1,"assets/images/matrix_pos_card_banner.png","Matrix POS is an offline-first retail Point-of-Sale system built with Role-Based Authentication and 2 dedicated portals: Admin and Cashier. The Admin portal allows store owners to register inventory items and onboard cashier staff. The Cashier portal enables fast retail checkout, automatic cart totals, and physical receipt printing via Bluetooth/USB thermal printers. Powered by high-speed Local Storage, it operates without internet delays.",B.HS)
